le_name": "BlindSimulator_Bus.png", "id": "1003437577895913", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391969_1003437581229246_653195394531631588_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=vlv-6jDb8m0Q7kNvwEE3LIX&_nc_oc=AdrKdO9-xBAlNZ1cAKu6NUk_R4xxUCmwAK48sG3ZngxxjDOp2KYYbko4Yjaafqz4e74&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQHLAcKrJwKd_b3S27ArAvuFfd6fA92Z9tn6-3F2FS6f7Q&oe=6A8ADE7E"}, {"file_name": "BlindSimulator_Stair.png", "id": "4044188659173246", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391885_4044188662506579_7546195151401081343_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=K1NFGbVu34AQ7kNvwFCoiwR&_nc_oc=AdrVXpqu1qKde1LD9vdoxGYIr_NmhLRlE470YM7eBmj992KfoWiUyULCcX-YQi9e0bw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGsYR-ZUPxFxBHD4K1I2aNDPVySrPTjQTdO8wXdQk3rog&oe=6A8AD6DA"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Trailer_Cover_Image.png", "id": "1367209481281777", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473396584_1367209484615110_5666152302652103209_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=PxCi-ft25SsQ7kNvwEuEANb&_nc_oc=AdpHBc7oX_gohQ2uMRppBMrVQLJ6q707QhCMV5ZSqpSszzadFfiriQEEvPVrfRI7WSo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQFqmK9iyBIDHLikt0d0bY8elScyJ1bfUyZ_YBnW6oDvaQ&oe=6A8AF646"}, "display_name": "BlindSimulator", "keywords": ["Blind", "Simulator", "Education", "Cane", "Experience"], "long_description": "**'Blind Simulator'** is a VR simulation game that offers a unique perspective by allowing players to experience the world as a blind person.\n\nPlayers begin the game without sight and must rely on a white cane as their only tool to explore their surroundings.\nTapping the cane on the ground creates a sonar effect, which temporarily reveals the shapes and objects in the nearby space.\n\n\n{1483889342761078}\n\n\nOn the journey to a hospital, players use public transportation such as buses and subways, and navigate crowded streets and unfamiliar environments \u2014 all within a fully virtual, safe-to-experience setting.\nThrough this process'**how to sense and understand the world without directly seeing it**'.\n\n\n{2251899381954384}\n\n\nThis game goes beyond a simple simulation \u2014 it conveys the everyday discomforts and fears faced by people with visual impairments.\nIt is designed with an educational purpose and presents a narrative-driven VR experience that resonates with players.\n\n\n{1438988117330894}\n\n\n**Start a new kind of exploration where you learn to \"see without seeing\" \u2014 using sound, vibration, and spatial awareness as your only guides.**\n\n\n{1846104142685848}", "short_description": "Experience the journey of a blind person navigating the world using only sound and touch in immersive VR."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Hero_Cover_BS.png", "id": "2518919831796602", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499293144_2518919835129935_1413575938524185386_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=vLcgljwfNxgQ7kNvwHSFDlY&_nc_oc=Adr2reTJ2UlPFvp0-LmiKwI_3434TJ687VgA-F2A5GPwXeiUrVtw5-A4AuON_8y2EDg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGGDjsxPaFgxqvGw_kslziaw6Cqe1WO-ANcYM7eHeUMZw&oe=6A8AC121"}, {"file_name": "Cover_Sight_BS.png", "id": "1889382115345316", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499623599_1889382118678649_1627841262428749483_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=sCoD-42JF2kQ7kNvwEmUj4E&_nc_oc=AdpturkZFyvsev7nAo16FpzdCl22DbVKzXs5kZnwD2pqfaDDSLvCG85P4YmqngGJfOM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQHYKmM5LJxdUoW2uxCdhrOVM4cjGRru8rn8iBPXv21fQg&oe=6A8AC071"}, {"file_name": "Logo_BS.png", "id": "1282969720083144", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/4